---
id: sausage-peas-breakfast
title: Sausage, Peas and Beans Breakfast Skillet
category: breakfast

yield:
  servings: 1
  cooked_g: 450

storage:
  fridge_days: 2
  freezer_friendly: false

---

Toast @bistro-sourdough-loaf{1%slice} in a #toaster until golden.

Heat a #skillet over medium-high heat with @unsalted-butter{1%tsp}. Sear @cheddar-smoked-sausage{1%link} sliced into coins for ~sear{2%minute} until browned on both sides.

Stir in @canned-pinto-beans{0.5%cup} (drained and rinsed), @frozen-green-peas{100%g}, @tomato-paste{1%tbsp}, and a splash of @chicken-broth{30%ml}. Season with @garlic-powder{0.25%tsp}, @smoked-paprika{0.25%tsp}, and a pinch of salt and pepper. Simmer for ~simmer{5%minute} until the peas are tender and the sauce thickens.

Push the mixture to the sides of the skillet. Crack in @eggs{2%count} and cook sunny-side up for ~fry{3%minute} until the whites are set.

Serve the skillet alongside the toast.
